Z||000005||Monkeyman||02-15-2000||06:06 AM||||Anyone remember the MLB strike a few years back?  That's the reason why I refuse to watch anymore.  Just a bunch of overgrown babies crying because they can't live on $3million a year.  I do tend to watch AAA/farm games if I can find them on the satellite.  I think they (as a group) are the ones playing for the love of the game instead of the $$.  Just my opinion.||||reg||1
