Z||000012||BENGAL4||02-15-2000||10:24 AM||||Mutfish, do I detect some jealousy in your post? It's all entertaiment. Whether they play ball, act on TV or the movies. People wan't to make what their market pays them. Baseball has become the have's and the have not's. New York, LA, Atlanta etc, have just about run the small market teams out of business. It's exciting that Griffey came here, for LESS MONEY. He could have received 20M per year, somewhere else. I glad he's here and I will attend more games because of it.  ||||reg||14
